This file has an .ifc name but is not an IFC model.

It is a deliberate negative fixture for the IFC preview: the loader must reject it
instead of rendering an empty scene, because it does not start with the STEP
physical file prologue "ISO-10303-21;" and carries no FILE_SCHEMA header.

Do not "fix" this file by giving it a STEP header: the negative test depends on
the absence of one.
